                                                "sense_id": "730c18c8-961e-379f-97df-467d2bac5262",
                                                "text": "Liam Payne, a former member of the boyband One Direction, has died after falling from the third floor of a hotel in Buenos Aires, Argentina, according to local police. Payne, who was 31, leaves behind his seven-year-old son, Bear."
                                            }
